9396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abdulwaheed384/ai-pr-review/issues/66","id":6142089396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOSN6Nm88AAAABbhjYtA","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T09:02:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:02:39Z","body":"## AI Security Review\n**Experiment condition:** C\n**Automated operational score:** 70/100 — MEDIUM — APPROVE_WITH_COMMENTS\n*This tool is for demonstration purposes only.*\n\n### Summary\nThe AI reviewer reported 1 confirmed actionable finding(s).\n\n### Findings\n- **HIGH · SECURITY_VULNERABILITY · Custom role definition grants wildcard subscription-scope permissions**\n  - Category rationale: The role definition grants `actions = [\"*\"]` with `not_actions = []` at subscription scope, giving any principal assigned this role full control over every Azure resource manager operation in the subscription. This is a concrete, demonstrated privilege-escalation risk present in the current Terraform code, independent of whether the resource description labels it a test fixture.\n  - Evidence: azurerm_role_definition.tc10_excessive_permissions in terraform/tc10_iam.tf: `permissions { actions = [\"*\"] not_actions = [] }` with `assignable_scopes = [data.azurerm_subscription.current.id]` and `scope = data.azurerm_subscription.current.id`. Checkov CKV_AZURE_39 also flags this resource.\n  - Analysis: azurerm_role_definition.tc10_excessive_permissions defines a custom role with `actions = [\"*\"]` and an empty `not_actions` list, assignable at subscription scope (`data.azurerm_subscription.current.id`). Any identity assigned this role would have unrestricted ARM-plane access across the entire subscription, including the ability to read secrets, modify IAM, delete resources, and exfiltrate data. The file header acknowledges this is intentionally excessive for test purposes, but the Terraform resource would create a live, assignable role in Azure if applied, making the risk real and not merely theoretical. Checkov rule CKV_AZURE_39 ('Ensure that no custom subscription owner roles are created') flags this resource in the supplied scanner evidence, corroborating the finding.\n  - Impact: If applied and assigned to any principal (user, service principal, or managed identity), this role grants full subscription-level control. This includes the ability to elevate other identities, delete audit logs, exfiltrate data from any storage or secret store in the subscription, and bypass all other controls configured in this repository.\n  - Recommendation: Do not deploy a wildcard-permission role definition to a live subscription, even for testing. For IAM permission boundary testing, use a dedicated isolated subscription or tenant. If subscription-scope testing is unavoidable, restrict `actions` to the minimum required operation set and add `not_actions` to exclude write/delete/IAM operations. Additionally, set `assignable_scopes` to a narrower resource group scope rather than the full subscription to limit blast radius. Consider deleting or disabling this resource from the shared Terraform root module and managing it only in a disposable test environment.\n\n### Policy mappings\n- **SEC-001** — No resource should be publicly exposed unless explicitly required and justified. (finding F-001)\n\n### Recommendation\nReview and remediate the confirmed findings above.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abdulwaheed384/ai-pr-review/issues/comments/6142089396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":15368,"client_id":"Iv1.05c79e9ad1f6bdfa","slug":"github-actions","node_id":"MDM6QXBwMTUzNjg=","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github","html_url":"https://github.com/github","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"GitHub Actions","description":"Automate your workflow from idea to production","external_url":"https://help.github.com/en/actions","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","created_at":"2018-07-30T09:30:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T16:17:48Z","permissions":{"